Keep tone consistent: same person and tense in one paragraph.. Substantial means

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
large in amount; a synonym is significant.. Mitigate means to make less severe;

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
synonyms are reduce and lessen.. A phenomenon is an observable fact, not an

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
