00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
widespread; synonyms are common and rife.. Scrutiny is close, critical

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
examination.. Robust means strong and hard to break down.. Viable means

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
workable; a synonym is feasible.. Compelling means convincing and hard to

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.500
